  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/I8Wm3eT9/images/a6cce411bebaa8a9a06b992c845b5afdd08a8c08.jpeg\" alt=\"卡通纹理包封面\"></p><h1>卡通纹理包</h1><hr><a href=\"\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"Modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/BrandonItaly/LCE-Resources\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"GitHub 多仓库\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/github-plural_vector.svg\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/BrandonItaly\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"GitHub赞助商 多形式\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/ghsponsors-plural_vector.svg\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fbrandonitaly\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"Ko-fi 多形式\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\"></a><p>大眼睛！滑稽笑容！用这款纹理包将你的世界变成卡通风格。</p><p>此纹理包为方块、物品、生物和用户界面添加了主题纹理。</p><hr><p>此资源包移植自《遗产主机版》的卡通纹理包，并更新了来自《基岩版》的纹理。原始纹理由 4J Studios 制作。</p>",
